OL,3,ADeadly shooting near Paris investigated
OL,4,Aas 'crime of terrorism', minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been killed and five
OL,7,Fothers wounded - three seriously - in a
OL,8,Fgun attack in a Parisian suburb which
OL,9,Fauthorities are investigating as
OL,10,F"terrorism".
OL,12,FSeveral drive-by shootings took place
OL,13,Fon Friday - first in Trappes to the
OL,14,Fsouth-west of Paris, and then in nearby
OL,15,FLa Verriere. The rampage lasted almost
OL,16,F15 minutes, said Interior Minister
OL,17,FLaurent Nunez. A12-year-old girl is
OL,18,Famong the wounded.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
