OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADeadly shooting near Paris investigated
OL,4,Aas 'crime of terrorism', minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspected attacker has been
OL,7,Farrested. The motive remains unclear,
OL,8,Fbut the National Anti-Terrorist
OL,9,FProsecutor's Office (PNAT) said the
OL,10,Fincident appeared to be "murder in
OL,11,Fconnection with a terrorist
OL,12,Fenterprise".
OL,14,FNunez told reporters in Trappes: "It's
OL,15,Fclearly a terrorist crime, that's what
OL,16,F[the prosecutor] has said."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
